" keys any key closes                                                            "
" Enter                      send (queues while the agent works)                 "
" Shift+Enter / Ctrl+J       newline                                             "
" Esc                        interrupt the run / close a popup; twice clears the "
" Ctrl+C                     clear the draft; twice quits                        "
" Ctrl+D                     back to the session list; twice quits               "
" Ctrl+P                     session palette                                     "
" Alt+↑ / Alt+↓              previous / next session                             "
" Ctrl+O / Ctrl+E            expand the last tool call / all                     "
" PgUp / PgDn                scroll the transcript                               "
" Ctrl+Home / Ctrl+End       jump to the top / bottom                            "
" Ctrl+A/E/K/U/W/Y, Alt+B/F  emacs editing                                       "
" 1-9 / Enter / Tab          answer a question / decide on a plan                "
" Ctrl+T                     search the transcript (Enter next · Esc close)      "
" Ctrl+G                     edit the draft in $EDITOR                           "
" Ctrl+` / Ctrl+Space        shell in the sandbox (again: back to the agent)     "
" Ctrl+L                     redraw                                              "
" ?                          this list (on an empty draft)                       "
"                                                                                "
" ● ready  Enter send · Ctrl+D sessions · Ctrl+P switch · ? keys    idx 8        "
